      "plainText" : "The installation arrangement of a cleanout shall enable cleaning of drainage piping only in the direction of drainage flow. \n\n Exceptions: \n\n 1. Test tees serving as cleanouts. \n\n 2. A two-way cleanout installation that is approved for meeting the requirements of Section 708.1.3."
